981adc988c733756"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you love games from the game studio FromSoftware you will love this game. Don't be put off by reviews saying you need friends on voice chat to enjoy this game. \r\n\r\nThis game has really grown on me and its replay value is great. Don't waste your money on incomplete games with excessive micro-transactions, instead spend the $40 to get this wonderful roguelike game with great art design and gameplay.", "timestamp_created": 1753309625, "timestamp_updated": 1753309625, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "200467390", "author": {"steamid": "76561198346550889", "personaname": "Nepherius", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198346550889/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 23, "playtime_forever": 26151, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 74, "playtime_at_review": 14547, "last_played": 1790995608, "avatar": "e557fbe113ffed0626a0a0897f6af189b77718f7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Edit after Libra was \"fixed.\"\n\nDepth of the Night: not worth the hassle, it's the same game but bosses are now HP sponges, damage is overtuned and most of the relics you get IF you manage to pass the match are useless or paired with detriments that make an already not fun mode even worse.\n\nTheir definition of more difficulty is  just adding more HP to bosses.", "timestamp_created": 1753308480, "timestamp_updated": 1759287616, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "hardware": {"syst